        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJdB8oMY6G7tVnDkZ_1-lDYSh2_YOuBQGhjmmMtQXYMqVexKg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 3,
        "relative_time_description": "a month ago",
        "text": "They have good stuff no doubt. I’m giving them 3 stars because they don’t respect their time. On more than two occasions, I have been there at the opening time and they were available an hour later. At the time of writing this review, I am there at 9:09am, the lights on the door says it is open. But the door is locked, they’re not answering their phone and no customer is able to access the store. If opening time is 9, please respect it and open the store at 9",
        "time": 1767795118,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "M",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117329566635487876915/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVphWr4GZwjoEkbpzII2z68xbRf9QzYKY3BpCBkkfYX1MBduWFV=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "a month ago",
        "text": "Poor service and unprofessional. The food purchased was very bad and expired.\n\nEdit to respond: take responsibility of your reviews. You dont know what I look like or my name, so you can’t somehow remember me. Your meat was discoloured and your spices are out of date. I have no relation to any other review. You’re arrogant beyond belief.",
        "time": 1768460491,
        "translated": false
      },
