        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "3 months ago",
        "text": "I am not the type to give a bad review but I  ordered a plate with kebab and when I came the meat they were cooking was brown it was not seasoned and when I received it it smelt rotten I gave it a taste and it tasted like old meat when I arrive I saw the man cooking my food take a pinch lick his finger and kept cooking … my daughter and I felt sick afterwards  I’ve ordered from here once before and it was ok  please do better",
        "time": 1763500439,
